    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Trust Deed for a Self Managed Superannuation Fund.",
            "block_bbox": [
                302,
                70,
                873,
                96
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "20. Trustee and Professional Advisors Responsibilities:.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                172,
                772,
                201
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The Trustees hereby appoint Superannuation Warehouse Australia Pty Ltd.as administrator of the Fund..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                216,
                292,
                1066,
                346
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.The administrator will:.",
            "block_bbox": [
                214,
                379,
                514,
                403
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "i. Provide accounting and taxation services to the Fund, and.",
            "block_bbox": [
                300,
                440,
                971,
                467
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "ii.  Appoint an auditor on behalf of the Fund.",
            "block_bbox": [
                293,
                501,
                794,
                526
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c.All Members are entitled to seek copies of any documents relevant to the.Fund that are maintained by the administrator..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                211,
                561,
                1050,
                618
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "21. Variation of the Trust Deed:.",
            "block_bbox": [
                130,
                715,
                508,
                738
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. This Deed may be varied by the Trustees on a prospective or retrospective.basis. This can be done at any time and must be signed by all Trustees..",
            "block_bbox": [
                212,
                807,
                1066,
                863
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "22. Legal Application and Requirements:",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                958,
                616,
                984
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. This deed will be interpreted consistent with a way that ensures the Fund \ncomplies with SISA, the ATO Guidelines, and any other relevant.\nregulations to ensure that it is a Complying Superannuation Fund..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                215,
                1049,
                1058,
                1139
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.  Trustees must at all times adhere to the rules of superannuation law and other laws relevant to this Fund..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                217,
                1173,
                1049,
                1228
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. The Fund must at all times be run in such a way that it qualifies for concessional tax treatment under the Income Tax Assessment Act..",
            "block_bbox": [
                220,
                1264,
                1001,
                1319
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "23. Fund Winding Up Procedures and Requirements:.",
            "block_bbox": [
                144,
                1387,
                762,
                1411
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Trustees are allowed to wind up the Fund when there are no Members.remaining in the Fund, or the Trustee determines for any legal reason that the Fund should be wound up..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                225,
                1447,
                1068,
                1531
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 14
        },
        {
            "block_label": "number",
            "block_content": "10",
            "block_bbox": [
                575,
                1612,
                598,
                1630
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": null
        }
    ],
